Dear Reviewer KAWd and Authors, 

It appears that a primary concern raised by Reviewer KAWd is how strong the correspondence between Hamiltonian Monte Carlo and Hamiltonian descent is.

@Reviewer KAWd: Besides this issue, do you think this paper has any other flaws from an optimization-theoretic perspective?

@Authors: If the proposed Hamiltonian descent algorithms are only inspired by Hamiltonian Monte Carlo, perhaps you should consider toning down the introduction a little bit. What do you think?

Best, 
AC

